Package: VoroGaze
Type: Package
Title: Local Research Workbench for Face-Viewing Fixation Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Green", email = "mjgreen@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs a local Shiny workbench for importing, mapping, checking,
    annotating, and summarising fixation data against researcher-defined facial
    areas of interest. Includes a small synthetic worked example.
